# Evidence note at 2026-10-17T05:24Z

- The first missing-topic runner attempt (`20261017T051613Z`) recorded Java's
  route miss as Maven failure because the client wraps response code 17 in an
  `MQClientException`. The route adapter now walks the cause chain and
  normalizes this Java outcome to `NO_ROUTE`; follow-up runs at
  `20261017T051736Z` and `20261017T051903Z` matched Rust. The first failure is
  retained as evidence, with trailing spaces on two blank `[ERROR]` lines
  removed so the archived output passes `git diff --check`.

